      "writtenOn": "2020-03-11T22:04:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The AC presence criteria could explain why other boards haven\u0027t needed this.  I believe we just had a GPIO for AC presence on GLK.  Does the TCPC register take a while to return a correct value?  Are there any other registers we could try using besides TCPC_REG_POWER_STATUS?",
      "parentUuid": "8bb57599_6bc52455",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1216,
